        "mapping": "Specific MICRO0001795 exact; native ID-label validation remains required.",
        "synonyms": "Three false Soy-owner claims require source-preserving disposition; reviewed Phytone spellings can be kept.",
        "supplied_form": "Keep BBL/BD-BBL descriptions source-qualified; UF and other soy-product lines are not synonyms.",
        "components": "No exact constituent recipe is established for the hydrolysate; do not turn starting soybean or enzyme into a complete has-part recipe.",
        "discussions": "Full504,114,170,148 comments were fetched; historical shared-ID classification is superseded only by this narrower evidence, without rewriting it."
