        }
      ],
      "coupling": [
        "Retain all original W03/W05 proposal bytes, genuine baseline history and source cases. A coordinator successor must explicitly state why one original owner follows its initial1769source and why Oxoid is a separate product; no owner merge is authorized.",
        "Treat source1769 and JCM481/482/612 as BD-specific provenance, not a global alias rule for the bare string Reinforced clostridial medium. Route known supplier contexts explicitly; generic or mixed-supplier occurrences remain unresolved until their supplier/version is known.",
        "Existing Dehydrated_RCM_Medium from MediaDive2126/DSMZ634 remains distinct and unresolved across permitted suppliers; do not silently redirect it or everyRCMrecipe to Difco. The explicit frozen catalog scan found this second relevant owner.",
        "No baseline component references to UNMAPPED0507 were found in all2956 frozen records. Independent ingredient-membership/source-case binding must still be reviewed; absence of catalog component edges does not collapse the source partition."
      ],
